# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Dungeons

step Dungeons: level 15-25
  tip The final boss of every level 15-25 dungeon earns one point together. Ragefire Chasm and Forever's Hall of Thanes (in Ironforge) count as one: either final boss does. Tick each boss off when you kill it, and check the in-game Legacy panel for the list.
  tip Alliance: the Ruins of Lordaeron's entrance is in the ruins beside the Undercity, among Horde guards: go with a group. Ragefire Chasm is inside Orgrimmar: the Hall of Thanes counts for it. Horde: the Hall of Thanes is inside Ironforge: Ragefire Chasm counts for it.
  kill 11519 optional         -- Ragefire Chasm: Bazzalan (or Hall of Thanes)
  kill 261319 optional        -- Hall of Thanes: Durgen Dirgehammer (or Ragefire Chasm)
  kill 256035                 -- Ruins of Lordaeron (Forever's, Tirisfal Glades): Viktor the Vile
  kill 3654                   -- Wailing Caverns (appears after the Disciple of Naralex's event)
  kill 639                    -- The Deadmines
  kill 4275                   -- Shadowfang Keep
  kill 260326                 -- Excavation Site: Wetlands (Forever's): Relic Guardian

step Dungeons: level 26-45
  tip The final boss of every level 26-45 dungeon earns one point together. The Drowned City and Krol'dok Stronghold (in the Riverglades) are new in Forever and not in our data: tick them off yourself.
  kill 246020                 -- City of Dalaran (Forever's, Alterac Mountains): Shade of the Archmage
  kill 4829                   -- Blackfathom Deeps
  kill 7800                   -- Gnomeregan
  kill "the final boss of the Drowned City"
  kill 4543                   -- Scarlet Monastery: Graveyard
  kill 6487                   -- Scarlet Monastery: Library
  kill 3975                   -- Scarlet Monastery: Armory
  kill 3977                   -- Scarlet Monastery: Cathedral
  kill 4421                   -- Razorfen Kraul
  kill "the final boss of Krol'dok Stronghold"

