  kill 10813                  -- Stratholme, Live side
  kill 10440                  -- Stratholme, Undead side
  kill 11492                  -- Dire Maul East
  kill 11501                  -- Dire Maul North
  kill 11486                  -- Dire Maul West
  kill "the final boss of the Shaper's Terrace"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Raids

step Raids: Onyxia
  tip Killing Onyxia is a point. Onyxia's Lair is a 40-player raid in Dustwallow Marsh, open from 9 December. Every raider needs the Drakefire Amulet in the bags: the Alliance chain starts with Dragonkin Menace in the Burning Steppes, the Horde chain with Blood and Thunder in Kargath (Badlands); both end in Upper Blackrock Spire with General Drakkisath.
  kill 10184                  -- Onyxia's Lair, Dustwallow Marsh

step Raids: Hyjal Summit
  tip All 13 Hyjal Summit bosses are a point. Hyjal Summit is a new 20-player Forever raid at the top of Mount Hyjal, near Nordrassil, open from 9 December; its bosses are not in our data, so tick it off once all 13 are down.
  kill "all 13 Hyjal Summit bosses"

step Raids: Barrow Deeps
  tip All 8 Barrow Deeps bosses are a point. Barrow Deeps is a new 10-player Forever raid beneath Mount Hyjal, entered from Mount Hyjal, Winterspring or Blackmaw Hold and open from 9 December; its bosses are not in our data, so tick it off once all 8 are down.
  kill "all 8 Barrow Deeps bosses"
